; LOAD MUNITIONS' CHIP on the Thorn (ruling 14). VISIBLE, until = 3 (START_OF_TURN, the Ramjet's
; "until the start of your next turn"). An ONHIT_EFFECT carrier gated on the loaded mount - see the
; script. The damage effect runs before the save effect. SP5: wears the system's own texture.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_chip")
effects = Array[ExtResource("2_onhit")]([ExtResource("3_damage"), ExtResource("4_impair")])
to = &"onhit_effect"
until = 3
icon = ExtResource("5_icon")
